-- 0015_javascript_skill_tests
--
-- Real question banks for the 9 leveled JavaScript skill tests (Beginner 1 to
-- Advanced 3), which 0012 seeded as inactive, content-empty placeholders. Each
-- bank holds about twice its target_question_count, so the /start route serves a
-- different random subset on a retake. Generated by db/skill-tests/build.mjs,
-- which ran every computable answer in Node and spread correct answers evenly
-- across the four positions.
--
-- Also retires 'javascript-fundamentals', per the plan in improvements.md (the
-- single-tier tests stay active only until their leveled equivalents exist).
-- is_active only hides it from the test list; past attempts and verified
-- badges keep working. Idempotent: fixed question ids + on conflict do nothing.

on conflict (id) do nothing;

